{"id":"hnqjev1xqb70szhahr16lzgna","title":"某团队解析IBM PC全运动视频渲染技术方案","originalTitle":"8088 Domination Post-Mortem","summary":"某团队在GitHub公开技术文档，详细解析如何在IBM PC（1981年型号）上实现全运动视频渲染。核心方案包括：1）通过差分更新（仅修改帧间变化区域）降低内存占用；2）采用有序抖动算法（Bayer dithering）优化CGA显示效果；3）设计优先级排序的数据结构（TDelta类），按面积、类型、颜色值等维度动态调整渲染顺序。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Hacker News 热榜"},"links":{"original":"https://trixter.oldskool.org/2014/06/19/8088-domination-post-mortem-part-1/"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-04T18:06:14.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-07T12:11:49.301Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-04T18:06:14.000Z","category":"cool-repos","tags":["新项目","技术方案","GitHub"],"score":65,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"github","name":"GitHub"},{"slug":"new-project","name":"新项目首发"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}